(6519933, 969783, 117912, '<td valign="top">As much as we try, we will never create colors like mother nature.  Nice composition thought the tonemapping might have put it a little over the edge for me.</td>', 'As much as we try, we will never create colors like mother nature.  Nice composition thought the tonemapping might have put it a little over the edge for me.', '2011-08-29 19:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
