(6519943, 969689, 117912, '<td valign="top">Gogeous reflections on a walk or a deck - Water can add so much to a photo.  Nice balance between the light and dark and the splashes of color.</td>', 'Gogeous reflections on a walk or a deck - Water can add so much to a photo.  Nice balance between the light and dark and the splashes of color.', '2011-08-29 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
