(6520770, 969694, 10785, '<td valign="top">The bright blue sky doesn''t quite say nightscape. I think you over exposed to get more light in your foreground and brightened up the twilight sky too much. Other than that, you have a nice leading line through the shot using the rock wall. Nice eye with that.</td>', 'The bright blue sky doesn''t quite say nightscape. I think you over exposed to get more light in your foreground and brightened up the twilight sky too much. Other than that, you have a nice leading line through the shot using the rock wall. Nice eye with that.', '2011-08-30 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520771, 968773, 114225, '<td valign="top">You must never leave this hill :)<br/>But another beautiful photo. I think I may actually like this one more than many of the later fog shots, as it''s much more unique.</td>', 'You must never leave this hill :)But another beautiful photo. I think I may actually like this one more than many of the later fog shots, as it''s much more unique.', '2011-08-30 09:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
