(6529388, 968773, 58634, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even make the correlation between this image and your "Us and Them" Skyline entry until <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> pointed it out. LOL<br/> <br/>Truly a gorgeous image, I was so amazed when I voted on it, you definitely deserved this ribbon. <br/> <br/>PS: Is it just me, or did you have a statement on your comment box about the shadow of a deer being next to the house? Maybe I dreamt that but I could''ve sworn I saw you posting that somewhere. O.O</td>', 'I didn''t even make the correlation between this image and your "Us and Them" Skyline entry until  Melethia pointed it out. LOL Truly a gorgeous image, I was so amazed when I voted on it, you definitely deserved this ribbon.  PS: Is it just me, or did you have a statement on your comment box about the shadow of a deer being next to the house? Maybe I dreamt that but I could''ve sworn I saw you posting that somewhere. O.O', '2011-09-05 19:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
